From 75cb3f3a9312d7f3694f493c0b308434229e2770 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "cl-6.dev@PrompTugal.dinis" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 03:31:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] cl-6.dev@PrompTugal.dinis: status page: the page list leaves
 the top on a phone; no 'blocked' in public mode

Under 700 px the newsroom's tab row is a closed 'Newsroom pages' fold (each line 44 px, 'You are here' on the current one) repeated at the foot; from 700 px the row wraps. The agent count is one sentence ('17 agents are waiting on a decision or a grant. 0 are working now.'); the word blocked is gone from the page and its twin.

Agent: cl-6.dev@PrompTugal.dinis
Issue: WS-14
For: Dinis
Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016CrbJKEPqF3pNfbncgHqvy
